; Allowlist for the DNS blocklists (zone rpz.allow, loaded first). One name per line:
;   example.com      CNAME rpz-passthru.     the name itself
;   *.example.com    CNAME rpz-passthru.     all names under it
; The firewall's own update and alert hosts are here, so a list error cannot stop the updates.
$TTL 300
@ SOA localhost. root.localhost. 1 3600 600 86400 300
  NS localhost.

deb.debian.org                CNAME rpz-passthru.
security.debian.org           CNAME rpz-passthru.
downloads.claude.ai           CNAME rpz-passthru.
api.anthropic.com             CNAME rpz-passthru.
github.com                    CNAME rpz-passthru.
api.github.com                CNAME rpz-passthru.
raw.githubusercontent.com     CNAME rpz-passthru.
objects.githubusercontent.com CNAME rpz-passthru.
release-assets.githubusercontent.com CNAME rpz-passthru.
www.spamhaus.org              CNAME rpz-passthru.
feodotracker.abuse.ch         CNAME rpz-passthru.
urlhaus.abuse.ch              CNAME rpz-passthru.
sslbl.abuse.ch                CNAME rpz-passthru.
rules.emergingthreats.net     CNAME rpz-passthru.
www.openinfosecfoundation.org CNAME rpz-passthru.
feeds.dshield.org             CNAME rpz-passthru.
www.ipdeny.com                CNAME rpz-passthru.
dynv6.com                     CNAME rpz-passthru.
ipv4.dynv6.com                CNAME rpz-passthru.
smtp.gmail.com                CNAME rpz-passthru.
